      "role": "user",
      "content": "those are good. but i feel like the traditionalist sounds almost too peaceful, almost like they're just being cautious. can you make their argument stronger? like, give them some actual logic about why rapid change is actually dangerous or even harmful to people's lives. \n\nand for the progressive, can you make them sound a bit more... i don't know, maybe a bit more unhinged or angry? like they've lost all patience and are just reacting out of pure frustration rather than structure. i want the contrast between the 'calm wisdom' and the 'chaotic energy' to be really sharp.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
